    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">TrustDemoDT04</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-TrustDemoDT04.html\">TD.DT.04 Is this dose of the national schedule due?</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">TD.DT.04 Is this dose of the national schedule due?</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.0.1/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-11-05 17:26:53+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">litlfred</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>For one action of the national schedule, decide whether the evaluation recommends it now, and from which date. Requirements: STD-SCH-001. Hit policy FIRST: the rules are tried in order and the first that matches applies.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Related Artifacts: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                <p><b>Documentation</b></p>\n                <ul>\n                    \n                    <li><a href=\"\"> Decision table TD.DT.04 (OMG DMN 1.3): dose-due.dmn</a></li>\n                    \n                </ul>\n                \n                \n                \n                <p><b>Dependencies</b></p>\n                <ul>\n                    \n                    <li><a href=\"PlanDefinition-TrustDemoLaoInfantSchedule.html\">National infant immunization schedule (illustrative excerpt)</a></li>\n                    \n                </ul>\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 1:</b> <div><p>When counted is true: forecast = complete. J3: the Hep B and BCG birth doses count once imported, so they are not recommended again (STD-SCH-001).</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 2:</b> <div><p>When counted is false and isNextVisit is true: forecast = due; dueDate = birthDate + timingAge. J3: pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1 at 6 weeks, due 2025-12-09 (ImmunizationRecommendation TrustDemoJ3Recommendation), with a reminder Task for that date.</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 3:</b> <div><p>When counted is false and isNextVisit is false: forecast = not-yet. J3: measles-rubella 1 at 9 months belongs to a later visit and is not in this recommendation.</p>\n</div>\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
